# Sprinting: the left stick click with the stick forward sprints; without the click the astronaut runs.
# Needs: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). The astronaut runs at 6 m/s and sprints at 10 m/s; the legs are
# short and the second goes back the way the first came, so the start base has room for them.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
# open ground: room to walk, nothing in the way
goto open
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# before: standing, speed nothing
read view
expect localSpeed < 0.3

# the left stick forward: a run
stick left 0 1
wait 1
read view
expect localSpeed > 4
expect localSpeed < 7.5
stick left 0 0
wait 0.5

# back to where it started
stick left 0 -1
wait 1
stick left 0 0
wait 1

# the left stick forward with its click: faster than any run
press left stick
stick left 0 1
wait 1.2
read view
expect localSpeed > 8
stick left 0 0
release left stick
wait 0.5
